  "reference_number": "RUS2531",
  "remarks": "\nTalat SAFAROV is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 based on the following ground:  \n \nThe Secretary of State considers that there are reasonable grounds to suspect that Talat SAFAROV has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by working as a director of CORAL ENERGY GROUP (now 2RIVERS GROUP) which has been carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely the Russian energy sector. \n",
